            'config': {'modelRoles': {'default': f'{pid}/{mid}'}},
            'notes': ['omp is a different harness from Pi CLI: it reads ~/.omp/agent/config.yml and models.db, never ~/.pi/agent/settings.json.',
                      'omp config set does NOT accept dotted keys (modelRoles.default) — set the whole modelRoles record as JSON, preserving the other roles.',
                      'omp only offers models it can resolve: the id must exist in its model cache (~/.omp/agent/models.db) or an extension provider, and the provider needs credentials. Run `omp models ls` to see the picker.',
                      'Model id format: <provider>/<model> (direct) or <provider>/<route>/<model> (extension gateways, e.g. codex-ccr/OpenCode Go/deepseek-v4-flash).',
                      'Limit the Ctrl+P picker: omp config set enabledModels \'["provider/model"]\'  or  omp config set disabledProviders \'["provider"]\'.',
